Step 2:
 Slit-Window Search (Replacing Index Subtraction)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Because Alice and Bob arrays are missing random events do not use Alice_Array(I) - Bob_Array(I).
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Instead,
