\begin_layout Itemize
Watch for Sync Counter Resets:
 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

In some of the longer NIST data runs the hardware time-tag counters can occasionally roll over or reset if the file crosses a specific size boundary.
 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

When parsing the find_sync.T1 files do a quick pass to ensure that the values are strictly monotonically increasing.
 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

If you spot a massive drop toward zero,
